{
 "priority": 7,
 "source_bins": [
  "talk.bin"
 ],
 "strings": {
  "Oh uh, I don't have that kinda money...": "",
  "(Without that gun mod, I don't think I'll be able to get much further in this case...)": "",
  "Sorry, Yagami-san, but parts are parts. Let me know if you can come up with it.": "",
  "(I'll have to do something eventually.)": "",
  "Yup. It shouldn't take more than a few shots to take out even a real sturdy drone.": "",
  "Wow, done already?": "",
  "Awesome. I think I should be able to manage.": "",
  "I'll be careful. Thanks, Makihara-kun!": "",
  "But hey... Only shoot if you need to, okay? The drone community doesn't need any murder mechs up there...": "",
  "(Okay. Time to head to the Millennium Tower and see if I can get Zhuang Shi to follow the Pigeon.)": "",
  "Sure, but the parts'll run about 100,000. That okay?": "",
  "Hey, Makihara-kun. Think you can install that gun mod to my drone now?": "",
  "There he is. Let's just come down without a fuss now, okay, kitty?": "",
  "...Right on schedule! But this time...": "",
  "What do you think of this!?": "",
  "Didn't I say I'd kill you if you interfered again!?": "",
  "And didn't I say I wouldn't be giving up on this cat?": "",
  "Such a stubborn man.": "",
  "But fine. If you would just cooperate with us, I will double the amount your \"client\" has offered.": "",
  "Cooperate? I don't even know you.": "",
  "Fine... I'll explain what this is truly about.": "",
  "Our boss died with... a considerable fortune. But it is hidden.": "",
  "Hidden?": "",
  "Yes. He was a very secretive man, and his fortune is stashed in a secret warehouse.": "",
  "But he was so wary of traitors, that not even his closest advisors know of this warehouse's location.": "",
  "Which means that he died with his secret.": "",
  "Yes. But now do you see? There is one who knows, in some way.": "",
  "You mean... the cat?": "",
  "Yes. Zhuang Shi was given free rein over this city, and frequently followed him to this warehouse.": "",
  "Which means the cat will seek his dead master there soon...": "",
  "And all we need to do is follow it.": "",
  "Then you don't need the cat at all. You just want him to lead you somewhere.": "",
  "That's right. The cat is useless after that.": "",
  "He who obtains this fortune will rule over the entire organization.": "",
  "Right, the cat is the crown. I get it now.": "",
  "A pity that Wang did not understand its true value.": "",
  "I see. I think I understand things pretty clearly now.": "",
  "Then how about it? Will you cooperate?": "",
  "Heh, sorry to make you reveal the whole plan, but I'm not really the type to betray my clients for money.": "",
  "Then I will silence your impudent mouth here and now. This will be your grave!": "",
  "You should bring a bigger crowd next time.": "",
  "D-Damn you!": "",
  "Now, where's that cat?": "",
  "Meow!": "",
  "Are you hungry now, guy?": "",
  "Meoooow.": "",
  "Did you remember that I had food? You're a smart one, huh?": "",
  "You know how much trouble you've caused me, though? Typical cat, I guess.": "",
  "Wait, what's this writing?": "",
  "Isn't this... an address?": "",
  "The hideout wasn't a secret... It's written right on the cat's tag...": "",
  "Not even a triad boss can think straight when it comes to his pets, huh?": "",
  "Or maybe he figured if the cat could trust you, so could he...": "",
  "The guy loved you, kitty.": "",
  "Meow.": "",
  "Incredible. That address was written plain as day on the collar.": "",
  "Highly unlike a man who was usually known for his caution...": "",
  "Well, I suppose he wanted people to know where to bring the cat if he ever got lost.": "",
  "Yes. I think it's safe to say he valued Zhuang Shi above all else.": "",
  "And that is why I will protect him for as long as he lives.": "",
  "Meowww.": "",
  "You hear that, kitty? You've gotta learn to like Wang-san here. He's your new owner.": "",
  "Thank you for your hard work, Yagami.": "",
  "You're welcome. If you ever need anything else, you know where to reach me.": "",
  "Indeed. I shall take my leave, then.": "",
  "(Sounds like Wang-san just got a new cat and a lot of money to look after him with.)": "",
  "(But the leader trusted him. And more importantly, so does the cat.)": "",
  "Nekomiya-san, I've got a cat question.": "",
  "...Don't do that. I'm looking for this cat. His name is Zhuang Shi.": "",
  "Yeah, but his owner died, and apparently he's been loose in Kamurocho since.": "",
  "Right. So I figure you'd be the one to ask. You haven't seen him, have you?": "",
  "Sorry... Nyan Nyan Café?": "",
  "True. Guess I'll head over there.": "",
  "Thanks, that helps a lot.": "",
  "I myself do not understand. But I know the man. And I know he will go to any means possible to find the cat.": "",
  "But to see Zhuang Shi handed over to someone out of pure self-interest would be devastating.": "",
  "How can someone who only sees an animal for its value be expected to care for its well-being?": "",
  "(Is the cat made of gold or something? How the heck does a cat have this much value?)": "",
  "I will not lie. This job may be dangerous. I will pay you 400,000 yen.": "",
  "Y-Yeah, that's fine... I'll take the case.": "",
  "I look forward to seeing Zhuang Shi soon.": "",
  "(I'd probably find a thousand stray cats in this city before I found the right one...)": "",
  "(Hmm... Maybe I can find someone who knows a little more about cats that can help me.)": "",
  "Cat questions are the best questions!": "",
  "What can I... mew for you?": "",
  "Zhuang Shi-chan, huh? How exotic. He a house kitty?": "",
  "Oh, how terrible. My stomach always sinks when I hear stories like that... We've got to find him!": "",
  "...Hmmmmm.": "",
  "I'm sorry I couldn't help you, but I don't recognize him.": "",
  "But... You could always try talking to the owner of the Nyan Nyan Café.": "",
  "It's a cat café on Senryo Avenue. The owner there takes in stray cats as well.": "",
  "And you never know, right?": "",
  "Nyan Nyan Café is on the third floor of the building with \"Happy Family\" in it on Senryo Avenue.": "",
  "Did you find a good home for that kitty?": "",
  "(He's doubling Wang-san's amount, huh? I gotta admit, that's not a low number to a broke guy like me.)": "",
  "...Meow!": "",
  "Kitty?": "",
  "(I think I'm being scolded for even considering it.)": "",
  "(Besides, there's no way this guy is going to take care of the cat once he gets his fortune...)": "",
  "(...And that's bullshit.)": "",
  "Oh, there he is. It's gotta be Zhuang Shi.": "",
  "Will you accept it?": "",
  "(Hey, it's a cat! But it's not Zhuang Shi...)": "",
  "You'll just have to die!": "",
  "(Wait, I can't take my eyes off of Zhuang Shi. Gotta figure out how to get it to follow me.)": "",
  "Welcome back. Always a pleasure to have you, sir.": "",
  "Huh? You actually remembered me?": "",
  "But of course. I remember all the names and faces of my valued customers. Call it a policy of mine.": "",
  "Hey, that's classy. I like it.": "",
  "Thank you. Please let me know if there's anything I can help you with. My name is Naotaro Terahara.": "",
  "I appreciate that. I'm Yagami, by the way.": "",
  "Then let me ask you, Yagami-sama. Would you be interested in a custom-tailored suit?": "",
  "Hmm. Well, that would be nice...": "",
  "But I don't really dress formal anymore.": "",
  "Is that so? I personally think you'd look quite handsome in a properly fitted suit.": "",
  "You sure you're not just buttering me up?": "",
  "Oh, no sir. My compliments are 100% butter-free.": "",
  "I pride myself in making every suit unique to match the customer's needs.": "",
  "So if you ever feel the need to spiff up your overall appearance, I'd be more than happy to assist you.": "",
  "Well then, whenever I need a suit, I'll come looking for you.": "",
  "Excellent. Then I'll be awaiting your visit.": "",
  "Shut your damn fool mouth and lemme have my suit the way I want it!": "",
  "B-But, sir... If you don't let me hem your pant legs, your suit will look quite baggy...": "",
  "Quit your bellyachin', tailor man! I like my suits like I like my ladies: loose, cheap, and not too clingy!": "",
  "I bet ya'd never figure as much, yapping on and on the way ya Tokyo stinkheads do... Always wastin' my goddamn time!": "",
  "Sir, that's not what I'm trying to... *sigh*": "",
  "(Why would anyone pick on their friendly neighborhood tailor? I can't just let this slide.)": "",
  "Terahara-san, is everything all right?": "",
  "Oh, Yagami-sama. Well, as you can see, this customer's suit is quite ill-fitting...": "",
  "Who's this boy band-looking knockoff? All I mean to do is make a normal-ass purchase, and now ya gather up a circus!": "",
  "You're the one making a big scene.": "",
  "Hey, it ain't my fault this high-and-mighty jabberjaw won't stop hemmin' and hawin' about hockin' off my hems! Sheesh!": "",
  "Like I said before, sir, if the hem of your pants were adjusted ever so slightly...": "",
  "Still runnin' yer mouth about it, huh? Why don't ya sew yer mouth shut! Better yet, I should do it for ya!": "",
  "Would you mind not yelling like that? You're upsetting the other customers.": "",
  "And just who do ya think yer talkin' to, Mr. Bigshot Tokyo Boy? You can't order me around!": "",
  "That's not my intention. I'm just asking you to show some basic manners.": "",
  "...Geez, what is wrong with that guy?": "",
  "Can't believe he's screaming his head off in public...": "",
  "See what ya did? Ya upset the other customers! Especially with that giant mop of pubes on your head.": "",
  "It's your lack of decency that's getting them all riled up. Why don't you show some respect?": "",
  "Ya want respect? <font_kind=yakuza_italic>I'll</font_kind> teach ya respect! Come on, we're takin' this outside!": "",
  "...Fine. Let's just get this over with.": "",
  "U-Um... Will you be all right, Yagami-sama?": "",
  "Nothing to worry about. I just need to step out real quick.": "",
  "If ya say you're gonna do it quick, then do it quick! I'm practically fallin' asleep here!": "",
  "Makin' a fool outta me back there... the nerve of ya! I'm about to put my foot up in your ass!": "",
  "Vulgar and violent. You really are a pain to deal with.": "",
  "Hah! Ya want a lesson in pain, huh? Then get ready to get schooled, prettyboy!": "",
  "What... in the hundred hells... just happened?": "",
  "Well? Have you finally learned your manners?": "",
  "Hey, ya don't need to rake me over the coals, now! I was just skippin' out on this rag store anyway!": "",
  "A moment, sir!": "",
  "For the last time, I don't give a damn anymore! I'm leavin'!": "",
  "Sir, I implore you to wait!": "",
  "This was all due to a lack of communication on my part. Please, allow me to explain.": "",
  "Huh? What're ya ramblin' about this time?": "",
  "I failed to mention this before, sir, but I noticed your shoes were quite worn down at the soles.": "",
  "Compared to how nice they look up top, I assumed that your profession requires a lot of walking.": "",
  "Well, yeah, ya could say that...": "",
  "As such, I thought that adjusting the hem would make it far easier for you to walk around. And it reduces wear and tear.": "",
  "Hmm, now that ya mention it, the pant legs do end up dragging an awful lot...": "",
  "No wonder my suit looks shot to shit.": "",
  "And that is precisely why I'd be honored to make you another one that fits you to a tee.": "",
  "...Well, why didn't ya say so in the first place! Guess I'll be leavin' this in your capable hands.": "",
  "Sorry I made such a big fuss back there. Make me a badass suit, yeah?": "",
  "With pleasure, sir!": "",
  "What an incredible turnaround... It's all thanks to you, Yagami-sama.": "",
  "Nah, it was all you. Customer service is no joke, huh?": "",
  "It's something I always take seriously. Now, at least let me do you a small favor. Perhaps I can make you that suit?": "",
  "That'd be great, but... how expensive would it be?": "",
  "Come now, you don't think I'd offer this on the house? After all you've done to help me?": "",
  "Seriously!? Hey, then I say go for it.": "",
  "Oh, but I don't remember my size...": "",
  "Not a problem. I've been in business so long, I can figure out a person's measurements with just one glance.": "",
  "That's quite a talent you've got there.": "",
  "All in a day's work. It won't be long before your suit is done, so please come by and pick it up when you have time.": "",
  "Got it, thanks so much!": "",
  "My pleasure, sir. You're going to like the way you look. I guarantee it.": "",
  "(Can't believe I'm getting a custom-made suit... for free! Thanks, Terahara-san. I'll be back soon.)": "",
  "Excellent timing, Yagami-sama. Your suit is ready when you are.": "",
  "Then suit me up, my good man.": "",
  "Very well. Please try this on.": "",
  "All right, let's see here...": "",
  "Wow... This really is the perfect fit.": "",
  "Just as I thought, it suits you quite superbly.": "",
  "It sure does. Are you okay just giving this away, though?": "",
  "Of course, it's my way of saying thank you. I'm just happy you like it.": "",
  "Heck yeah! You really hooked it up.": "",
  "We hope our establishment continues to be in your favor.": "",
  "Thanks for the meal.": "",
  "Glad you enjoyed it, sir. Thanks for always stopping by!": "",
  "By the way, have you heard we're adding a new entree?": "",
  "Oh yeah? Can't wait to try it.": "",
  "Please do. I came up with the recipe myself, and I must say, it's one of my finest creations.": "",
  "Interesting. Are you the manager, by any chance?": "",
  "That's right! Please call me Nasugawa.": "",
  "Got it. I'm Yagami. It's nice to meet you.": "",
  "Nice to meet you too, Yagami-san. Please come back and try our new entree. I'm sure you'll love it!": "",
  "I'm sure I will. Next time, then.": "",
  "Wonderful! Then I hope to see you again soon.": "",
  "Hey, how's that entree coming along?": "",
  "Well, you see... I uh...": "",
  "You know that new dish I've been working on? Well... I went and lost the dang recipe!": "",
  "Wait. Really?": "",
  "Did you at least save a picture on your smartphone?": "",
  "I'm afraid not. The rule is that our recipes are always handwritten, so no one can copy our menu.": "",
  "And I assume no one else in the restaurant had memorized it?": "",
  "If they did, I wouldn't be here retracing my steps, only to realize I'm a complete idiot! Argh... stupid, stupid, stupid!": "",
  "...Sorry for the outburst. But seriously, I'm stumped. Of course it had to happen during a one-man shift...": "",
  "You mean it's only you on the floor?": "",
  "Yes, that's why I can't go out and look for it.": "",
  "Oh, what should I do... It's supposed to be a top-secret recipe!": "",
  "Damn. Hope no one else finds it.": "",
  "Uh... Yagami-san?": "",
  "Could you maybe... do me a favor and find it for me?": "",
  "Huh? But I...": "",
  "Pretty please! I can't leave this store unattended, you see... I'll repay you somehow, I promise!": "",
  "Oh, all right...": "",
  "Yes! You're the best!": "",
  "So, where should I start looking?": "",
  "Okay. The route I took to work today began on Tenkaichi Street. I walked all the way to the end and took a right...": "",
  "And after that?": "",
  "Then I stopped for a bit at M Side Cafe. Bought coffee. Chatted a bit. Then I went down Theater Avenue...": "",
  "Once I passed the Batting Center, I was pretty much a stone's throw away from here.": "",
  "I'm sure it's somewhere on that route...": "",
  "Got it. Then I'll let you know once I find it. Can you give me your contact ID?": "",
  "Okay, will do! I'll text you my commuting route as well!": "",
  "(...Hm? Could this be Nasugawa's top-secret recipe?)": "",
  "(He'll be happy to have it back, no doubt. I should drop this off at Akaushimaru.)": "",
  "Found it. Here you go.": "",
  "Oh, thank goodness! You came through right in the nick of time.": "",
  "Careful not to lose it again, now.": "",
  "I won't! At least... I hope not. Anyway, I need to get this to my part-timer and start cooking right away!": "",
  "Get ready to enter a world of deliciousness, Yagami-san!": "",
  "Oh, I've been ready.": "",
  "(The barkeep is calling me?)": "",
  "Hello? What's up, Masuda-san?": "",
  "Hm? Mari?": "",
  "Wait, what are you playing at? That woman wouldn't talk about herself to save her life.": "",
  "...And wasn't I just <font_kind=yakuza_italic>at</font_kind> Tender? You already miss me?": "",
  "(The jerk hung up on me. Can't fault the guy for knowing how to make a sale, though.)": "",
  "(Guess I'll head to Tender.)": "",
  "Apparently he thinks I'll be good at this. That, or he's desperate.": "",
  "So if we're all putting down 10k, I would make it a <font_kind=yakuza_italic>whopping</font_kind> 40k?": "",
  "How could I refuse? Count me in.": "",
  "Nah, I think I'll pass.": "",
  "It's not that...": "",
  "Crap. I don't have 10,000.": "",
  "Sorry. Sit tight, I'll be right back.": ""
 },
 "ref_tm": {
  "D-Damn you!": "เ-แกนี่มัน!",
  "Meow!": "เมี้ยว!",
  "Meow.": "เมี้ยว",
  "Huh? But I...": "หา? แต่หนู...",
  "Oh, all right...": "อ้อ โอเคค่ะ...",
  "Nah, I think I'll pass.": "ไม่เอาดีกว่า ฉันขอผ่าน"
 }
}
